  "body": "# Kuku 0.5.8\r\n\r\n## Highlights\r\n- Rebuilt Agent World with real 3D Kuku characters, houses, cel shading, terrain, paths, sky, and nature \r\n- Agent World is still early-stage and disabled by default. Enable it from Settings > Plugins, restart the app, and try it when you want to \r\n- Added focus, hover, and selection rings so notes and agents are easier to \r\n- Added Agent World render settings for visible agent count, movement speed, and nature density.\r\n- Optimized 3D model assets and tightened world resource cleanup.\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/kuku-mom/kuku/compare/0.5.7...0.5.8"
